Visual Basic: DelegateDecompiler.Tests.VB.vbproj: Visual Basic projects are left alone, 'format' runs on the C# projects only.
StyleBro's analyzers aren't loaded: no project has StyleBro.Analyzers in its restore output (obj/project.assets.json), so 'dotnet format' would fix only whitespace and the built-in rules and report clean. Directory.Build.props has the StyleBro.Analyzers reference, but MSBuild reads only the nearest Directory.Build.props and src/Directory.Build.props doesn't import it: put the reference in src/Directory.Build.props (or import the parent's there). Then run again (https://bisforboman.github.io/stylebro/getting-started/).
